# Keep the Docker build context small and deterministic. The service images build from the
# repository root (the reactor needs the parent POM, .mvn settings, and shared libs), so this
# excludes build output, dependencies, local-only docs, and secrets from every image layer.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/
.git/
.github/
.pnpm-store/
# Local-only agent config and internal docs (never in an image).
.claude/
docs/
infrastructure/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
# Never bake env files / secrets into a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
# Test/coverage output.
**/coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/blob-report/
# Playwright E2E specs are not a build input for any image.
apps/admin-web/e2e/
# IDE / OS noise.
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.log
